        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "A database is not one thing. It is a **stack of cooperating subsystems**, each solving a\ndifferent hard problem, nested so that the guarantees of the top layer rest on the mechanisms\nof the layers below. The query language you write (`SELECT ... WHERE ...`) sits at the very\ntop. This directory is everything *underneath* that line."
